        <x>70</x>
        <y>27</y>
        <width>264</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>GRD: radar backscatter on a ground-range grid, 10 m pixels (IW), about 1.7 GB a scene; the one this dialog can show. GRD COG: the same as cloud-optimised GeoTIFFs, about half the size. SLC: the complex signal with its phase, for interferometry (InSAR), 4 to 8 GB. OCN: ocean wind, waves and radial currents (Level-2, netCDF). RAW: the raw signal (Level-0).</string>
      </property>
      <property name="refresh" stdset="0">
       <bool>true</bool>
      </property>
     </widget>
