      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>The acquisition mode. IW (Interferometric Wide swath, 250 km): the usual mode over land and coastal seas. EW (Extra Wide, 400 km): polar seas and sea ice. SM (StripMap, 80 km): small islands and emergencies. WV (Wave): open-ocean vignettes for wave spectra.</string>
      </property>
